# Example requests for POST /v1/personalize.
# Run with the VS Code REST Client extension or a JetBrains IDE's HTTP client.
# Start the server first: `npm run dev` (or `FAKE_PRICING=error npm run dev` to simulate an outage).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Tenant 0 member: savings rate + members-only rewards card
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "tenant0",
  "surface": "offers",
  "user": { "id": "member-1", "claims": {} }
}

### Switchback user, eligible: baseline savings + Switchback Partner Rate
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "switchback",
  "surface": "offers",
  "user": {
    "id": "worker-1",
    "claims": { "sb_tenure_months": 8, "sb_monthly_earnings_usd": 4100 }
  }
}

### Switchback user, not eligible (tenure too short): baseline savings only
# The decision record in the server log explains why: "tenureMonths >= 6: fail"
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "switchback",
  "surface": "offers",
  "user": {
    "id": "worker-2",
    "claims": { "sb_tenure_months": 3, "sb_monthly_earnings_usd": 4100 }
  }
}

### Tenant 0 request carrying Switchback-shaped claims: still no Switchback offers
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "tenant0",
  "surface": "offers",
  "user": {
    "id": "member-2",
    "claims": { "sb_tenure_months": 99, "sb_monthly_earnings_usd": 99999 }
  }
}

### Dashboard surface: includes the tenant's content (guide)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "switchback",
  "surface": "dashboard",
  "user": {
    "id": "worker-1",
    "claims": { "sb_tenure_months": 8, "sb_monthly_earnings_usd": 4100 }
  }
}

### Existing tenant 0 caller that doesn't send `tenant`: treated as tenant 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "surface": "offers",
  "user": { "id": "member-3", "claims": {} }
}

### Unknown tenant: 400 unknown_tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "acme",
  "surface": "offers",
  "user": { "id": "someone", "claims": {} }
}

### Malformed request (missing user): 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/personalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "tenant0",
  "surface": "offers"
}
